Forward Proxy                                            Reverse Proxy
Hides Clients Identity                                    Hides Servers identity
Sits B/W Client and Server                                
Client only aware about proxy                             Server Aware
VPN, content filtering                                    Security reasons and QUEUE Management(Load balancing)
Can be used as Cache                                      Used for SSL Termination


